# Local Database Artifacts
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sql.gz

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Master High-Volume Datasets (60MB+ Raw Simulation Data)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw multi-gigabyte or 60MB+ simulation CSV dumps are excluded from Git history.
# Tabular schemas, dictionaries, small spatial coordinate CSVs, and analytical
# charts in Datasets/ remain tracked.
Heat Shield Master Dataset*.csv
Datasets/datasets/Heat Shield Master Dataset*.csv
Datasets/datasets/HeatShield DataSet Solapur.csv
*.csv.gz

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TRACKED ASSETS NOTICE (Do NOT ignore):
# The following directories and asset types MUST remain tracked:
# - Banner & Logo/          (Vector and raster branding assets)
# - Website Design Files/   (Research design wireframes, screens, and specs)
# - Datasets/charts/        (High-resolution analytical figures)
# - public/                 (Favicons, branding, and manifest assets)
# - docs/design-research/   (Apple-inspired design system documentation)
# - supabase/migrations/    (PostgreSQL DDL migrations and seed files)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
